OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #14m air ambulance base
OL,4,Aset for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a #14m air ambulance base in
OL,7,FLeicestershire are set to be given the
OL,8,Fgo-ahead.
OL,10,FHarborough District Council's planning
OL,11,Fcommittee is recommended to approve a
OL,12,Fplanning application on Tuesday from
OL,13,FThe Air Ambulance Service (TAAS) to
OL,14,Fbuild an airbase on land off Swinford
OL,15,FRoad in Catthorpe.
OL,17,FThe charity has been operating from its
OL,18,Fcurrent base for more than 23 years,
OL,19,Fbut with Coventry Airport due to become
OL,20,Fa centre for battery production, a new
OL,21,Flocation had to be found.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
