OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #14m air ambulance base
OL,4,Aset for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposed airbase would include two
OL,7,Fhelipads, a hangar, welfare facilities
OL,8,Ffor crew members, including bedrooms,
OL,9,Frest areas and a gym, training
OL,10,Ffacilities and incident simulation
OL,11,Frooms.
